## Production Environment Variables

# Backend API Base URL
# Use /api for same-domain deployment and local Vite proxy.
VITE_API_URL=/api

# For subpath deployment (uncomment and set if deployed to /app/ or similar)
# VITE_BASE_URL=/app/

## Deployment Notes:
# 1. Copy this to .env and adjust VITE_API_URL to your backend
# 2. For subpath: set base in vite.config.js to match VITE_BASE_URL
# 3. Build: npm run build
# 4. Serve dist/ with SPA rewrite (see README.md)
